Quickdatasetup
# downloadtheprimarydataset (GCDD)next tothis repo'sdatafolder
git clonehttps://github.com/dawn-a/Global-copper-deposit-dataset.gitdata/raw/gcdd
# MindatandMRDSrecordsarethenpulledby the integrationpipeline:
